 "name": "Spanish state toll motorways (SEITT)",
 "law": "Acuerdo del Consejo de Ministros de 3 de diciembre de 2024 (BOE 18/12/2024), SEITT's tariff regime for 2025-2032: SEITT's 2025 tariffs by entry and exit, Pesados 1 (two or three axles) and Pesados 2 (four or more), cash prices, tag prices for trucks paying by Vía-T (etc), excluding 21% IVA; free from 00:00 to 06:00. Stations placed at OpenStreetMap's toll booths of their name (extract of 2026-11-08); 4 stations without one aren't priced. Only SEITT's AP-36, AP-41 and AP-7 Cartagena–Vera (not the Madrid radials or M-12); the concessions (AP-6, AP-9, AP-46, AP-51, AP-53, AP-61, AP-66, AP-68, AP-71, AP-7 Málaga–Guadiaro and Alicante–Cartagena) aren't included. The AP-41's 2025 tariff isn't served or archived any more, so it isn't priced here.",
